trying to look at the answer.

00:01:06.499 --> 00:01:10.537
-I wasn't, I wasn't!
-A nickelback?

00:01:10.537 --> 00:01:12.338
-Tight end, fullback,
or nickelback?

00:01:12.338 --> 00:01:13.740
-I've definitely
heard of tight end.

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:16.409
I think it's "B."
-Okay, your answer is locked in.

00:01:16.409 --> 00:01:18.978
